{
  "version": 1,
  "meta": {
    "titulo": "El sísmico del galpón del altiplano — las dos rutas de la Tabla 7, NCh 2369:2025",
    "ficha": "struct_pad/src/content/apuntes/ejemplo-galpon-altiplano-sismico-nch2369.mdx",
    "esperadoFalso": {
      "v_banda_x5": "Es la tesis del post. Con R = 5 (fila 5.5) el corte basal de la dirección de marcos queda 1,82 % bajo el Q0mín de la Ec. (12), y por eso §5.12 amplifica todas las fuerzas y la Ec. (14) recorta el R1 de 5,00 a 4,908819. Si este veredicto diera verdadero, la fila 5.5 entregaría el R que promete — y no lo entrega."
    }
  },
  "regions": [
    { "id": "s-00", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 40, "src": "━━ SITIO · Tablas 3 y 6 de NCh 2369:2025, leídas rasterizadas el 2026-08-12 ━━" },
    { "id": "s-01", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 86, "src": "Ar := 0.42" },
    { "id": "s-02", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 132, "src": "S_s := 1.00" },
    { "id": "s-03", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 178, "src": "T0 := 0.30 s" },
    { "id": "s-04", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 224, "src": "r_s := 4.5" },
    { "id": "s-05", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 270, "src": "p_s := 1.6" },
    { "id": "s-06", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 316, "src": "q_s := 3.0" },
    { "id": "s-07", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 362, "src": "T1 := 0.27 s" },
    { "id": "s-08", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 408, "src": "Ar es A_r/g de la zona sísmica 2. El suelo es Tipo B. Categoría II → I = 1,00 (§4.3), y ξ = 0,02 por uniones soldadas (columna ξ de la Tabla 7)." },
    { "id": "s-09", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 454, "src": "I_imp := 1.00" },
    { "id": "s-10", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 500, "src": "xi := 0.02" },

    { "id": "m-00", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 546, "src": "━━ DATOS DEL MODELO · galpon_altiplano.sdb (SAP2000 v27.1). Nada de esto se deriva acá ━━" },
    { "id": "m-01", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 592, "src": "P := 674.8610909934324 kN" },
    { "id": "m-02", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 638, "src": "Tx := 0.8526565963541679 s" },
    { "id": "m-03", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 684, "src": "Ty := 0.1610608923144279 s" },
    { "id": "m-04", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 730, "src": "Q0x4 := 86.96022871934747 kN" },
    { "id": "m-05", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 776, "src": "Q0y4 := 130.25718886418443 kN" },
    { "id": "m-06", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 822, "src": "Q0x5 := 69.56818297547798 kN" },
    { "id": "m-07", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 868, "src": "Q0y5 := 121.39480759923802 kN" },
    { "id": "m-08", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 914, "src": "Q0xR := 347.8409148773899 kN" },
    { "id": "m-09", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 960, "src": "Q0yR := 498.9063138060352 kN" },
    { "id": "m-10", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 1006, "src": "Q0xR y Q0yR son los cortes con el espectro de REFERENCIA de §6.1, sin R*. Tx es el modo 1 (U_x = 94,63 %) y Ty el modo 41 (U_y = 47,42 %)." },
    { "id": "m-11", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1052, "src": "d_al := 0.113504 m" },
    { "id": "m-12", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1098, "src": "d_ar := 0.006912 m" },
    { "id": "m-13", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1144, "src": "h_al := 8.0 m" },

    { "id": "f-00", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 1190, "src": "━━ LAS DOS FUNCIONES DE LA NORMA ━━" },
    { "id": "f-01", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1236, "src": "f_xi := (0.05/xi)^0.4 =" },
    { "id": "f-02", "kind": "program", "x": 40, "y": 1282, "src": "saH(T) :=\n    ratio := T / T0\n    return Ar * S_s * (1 + r_s * ratio^p_s) / (1 + ratio^q_s)" },
    { "id": "f-03", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 1420, "src": "↑ Ec. (3) de §5.4.2. El espectro de referencia de §6.1 es I·S_aH(T)·f_xi; el de diseño, ese mismo dividido por R*." },
    { "id": "f-04", "kind": "program", "x": 40, "y": 1466, "src": "rstar(T, R) :=\n    if R <= 1\n        return 1\n    lim := 0.16 * R * T1\n    if T >= lim\n        return R\n    return 1.5 + (R - 1.5) * (T / lim)" },
    { "id": "f-05", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 1650, "src": "↑ Ec. (1b) de §5.4.1, con C_r = 0,16·R. R* se evalúa UNA vez, en el T* de la dirección de análisis, y queda constante en todo el espectro." },

    { "id": "e-00", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 1696, "src": "━━ EL ESPECTRO EN LOS DOS T* · contra lo que midió el modelo ━━" },
    { "id": "e-01", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1742, "src": "SaRx := I_imp * saH(Tx) * f_xi =" },
    { "id": "c_sarx", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1788, "src": "abs(SaRx - 0.6306425) < 0.000001 =" },
    { "id": "e-02", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1834, "src": "SaRy := I_imp * saH(Ty) * f_xi =" },
    { "id": "c_sary", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1880, "src": "abs(SaRy - 1.3975929) < 0.000001 =" },
    { "id": "e-03", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1926, "src": "razon_Sa := SaRy / SaRx =" },
    { "id": "e-04", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 1972, "src": "↑ la dirección arriostrada, que es la rígida, lee una ordenada 2,2 veces mayor. Ahí empieza el +49,8 % de corte basal." },

    { "id": "r-00", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 2018, "src": "━━ EL CODO SE MUEVE CON EL R, Y EL T* LONGITUDINAL QUEDA BAJO LOS DOS ━━" },
    { "id": "r-01", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2064, "src": "codo4 := 0.16 * 4 * T1 = s" },
    { "id": "r-02", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2110, "src": "codo5 := 0.16 * 5 * T1 = s" },
    { "id": "v_ty_bajo", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2156, "src": "Ty < codo4 =" },
    { "id": "r-03", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2202, "src": "holgura_ty := 1 - Ty/codo4 =" },
    { "id": "r-04", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2248, "src": "Rx4 := rstar(Tx, 4) =" },
    { "id": "r-05", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2294, "src": "Ry4 := rstar(Ty, 4) =" },
    { "id": "c_ry4", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2340, "src": "abs(Ry4 - 3.830163) < 0.000001 =" },
    { "id": "r-06", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2386, "src": "Rx5 := rstar(Tx, 5) =" },
    { "id": "r-07", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2432, "src": "Ry5 := rstar(Ty, 5) =" },
    { "id": "c_ry5", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2478, "src": "abs(Ry5 - 4.109783) < 0.000001 =" },

    { "id": "x-00", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 2524, "src": "━━ EL CHEQUEO DE UNA LÍNEA · referencia / diseño tiene que dar el R* de esa dirección ━━" },
    { "id": "x-01", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2570, "src": "coc_x := Q0xR / Q0x4 =" },
    { "id": "c_coc_x", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2616, "src": "abs(coc_x - Rx4) < 0.000001 =" },
    { "id": "x-02", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2662, "src": "coc_y := Q0yR / Q0y4 =" },
    { "id": "c_coc_y", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2708, "src": "abs(coc_y - Ry4) < 0.000001 =" },
    { "id": "x-03", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 2754, "src": "↑ si alguno de los dos no da clavado, uno de los dos espectros está mal cargado en el modelo. Es lo primero que hay que mirar." },

    { "id": "b-00", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 2800, "src": "━━ LA BANDA · Ec. (12) de §5.12 y Ec. (13) de §5.13 ━━" },
    { "id": "b-01", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2846, "src": "Q0min := 0.25 * I_imp * Ar * S_s * P = kN" },
    { "id": "c_q0min", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2892, "src": "abs(Q0min - 70.860415 kN) < 0.000001 kN =" },
    { "id": "b-02", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2938, "src": "Q0max4 := 2.75 * I_imp * Ar * S_s / (4 + 1) * f_xi * P = kN" },
    { "id": "c_q0max4", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2984, "src": "abs(Q0max4 - 224.906690 kN) < 0.000001 kN =" },
    { "id": "b-03", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3030, "src": "Q0max5 := 2.75 * I_imp * Ar * S_s / (5 + 1) * f_xi * P = kN" },
    { "id": "c_q0max5", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3076, "src": "abs(Q0max5 - 187.422241 kN) < 0.000001 kN =" },
    { "id": "b-04", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 3122, "src": "El techo baja al subir el R —divide por (R+1)— y el piso no lleva R, así que se queda donde estaba." },

    { "id": "v-00", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 3168, "src": "━━ LOS CUATRO CORTES CONTRA SU BANDA ━━" },
    { "id": "v_banda_x4", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3214, "src": "Q0x4 >= Q0min and Q0x4 <= Q0max4 =" },
    { "id": "v_banda_y4", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3260, "src": "Q0y4 >= Q0min and Q0y4 <= Q0max4 =" },
    { "id": "v_banda_y5", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3306, "src": "Q0y5 >= Q0min and Q0y5 <= Q0max5 =" },
    { "id": "v_banda_x5", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3352, "src": "Q0x5 >= Q0min =" },
    { "id": "v-01", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 3398, "src": "↑ ESTE ✗ es la tesis del post: es el único de los cuatro que no cumple, y por abajo." },
    { "id": "v-02", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3444, "src": "deficit := 1 - Q0x5/Q0min =" },

    { "id": "k-00", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 3490, "src": "━━ LO QUE COBRA EL MÍNIMO · §5.12 amplifica, y la Ec. (14) de §5.14 descuenta ━━" },
    { "id": "k-01", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3536, "src": "amp512 := Q0min / Q0x5 =" },
    { "id": "k-02", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3582, "src": "R1x5 := Rx5 * min(Q0x5/Q0min, 1) =" },
    { "id": "c_r1x5", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3628, "src": "abs(R1x5 - 4.908819) < 0.000001 =" },
    { "id": "k-03", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3674, "src": "R1x4 := Rx4 * min(Q0x4/Q0min, 1) =" },
    { "id": "k-04", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 3720, "src": "En la ruta R = 4 el segundo factor vale 1 y el R1 es directamente el R*. En la ruta R = 5 no, y es la primera vez en la serie que muerde." },

    { "id": "a-00", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 3766, "src": "━━ QUÉ SE LLEVA CADA RUTA · en unidades de la demanda elástica E_el ━━" },
    { "id": "a-01", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3812, "src": "prot4 := 0.5 * R1x4 * (1 / Rx4) =" },
    { "id": "a-02", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3858, "src": "prot5 := 0.7 * R1x5 * (amp512 / Rx5) =" },
    { "id": "c_prot4", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3904, "src": "abs(prot4 - 0.500) < 0.000001 =" },
    { "id": "c_prot5", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3950, "src": "abs(prot5 - 0.700) < 0.000001 =" },
    { "id": "a-03", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 3996, "src": "↑ los dos R se cancelan y quedan las dos tarifas: los elementos protegidos se diseñan para 0,500 E_el por §12.2 y 0,700 E_el por la fila 5.5." },
    { "id": "a-04", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 4042, "src": "fus4 := 1 / Rx4 =" },
    { "id": "a-05", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 4088, "src": "fus5 := amp512 / Rx5 =" },
    { "id": "a-06", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 4134, "src": "sobrecosto := fus4/fus5 - 1 =" },
    { "id": "a-07", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 4180, "src": "↑ el encarecimiento real de los fusibles al ir por §12.2 es 22,7 %, no el 25 % de la comparación general: el corte mínimo se comió 2,3 puntos." },

    { "id": "d-00", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 4226, "src": "━━ LA DERIVA · §6.1 con el espectro de referencia, contra el límite de §6.3 ━━" },
    { "id": "d-01", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 4272, "src": "d_lim := 0.015 * h_al = m" },
    { "id": "v_deriva_x", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 4318, "src": "d_al < d_lim =" },
    { "id": "v_deriva_y", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 4364, "src": "d_ar < d_lim =" },
    { "id": "d-02", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 4410, "src": "uso_x := d_al / d_lim =" },
    { "id": "d-03", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 4456, "src": "uso_y := d_ar / d_lim =" },
    { "id": "d-04", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 4502, "src": "margen := 1 - uso_x =" },
    { "id": "d-05", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 4548, "src": "El mismo 0,015·h es el gatillo del P-Delta de §6.4: con uso_x = 1 el galpón cumpliría §6.3 justo y ya estaría obligado al segundo orden." },

    { "id": "n-00", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 4594, "src": "━━ EL MALLADO · §5.34 mide cuánto sobreestima la deriva cada malla, contra N = 36 ━━" },
    { "id": "n-01", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 4640, "src": "err_N1 := 0.3780" },
    { "id": "n-02", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 4686, "src": "err_N2 := 0.0923" },
    { "id": "n-03", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 4732, "src": "err_N3 := 0.0398" },
    { "id": "v_malla_1", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 4778, "src": "err_N1 > margen =" },
    { "id": "v_malla_2", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 4824, "src": "err_N2 > margen =" },
    { "id": "n-04", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 4870, "src": "Los dos veredictos verdaderos son el cierre del post: con uno o dos tramos por columna el error de malla es MAYOR que el margen, así que el mismo" },
    { "id": "n-05", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 4916, "src": "modelo habría dicho «reprueba». La malla adoptada es N = 4, entre las filas N = 3 (+3,98 %) y N = 6 (+0,95 %) del estudio de convergencia." }
  ]
}
